        <li>QuantumScape — QSE-5 deployment (Ducati, IAA Munich) and Eagle Line pilot facility, Feb 2026.</li>
        <li>Toyota / Samsung SDI — pilot-line progress announcements, 2025–2026.</li>
        <li>Industry reporting — MG4 semi-solid vehicles and Mercedes road tests, 2025–2026.</li>
      </ul>

